  "description": "Wedding is an elegant and fluid handwritten script font that captures the essence of a modern, sophisticated typeface. It features graceful, high-contrast strokes with sweeping loops and fine, tapering terminals that give the letterforms a rhythmic and natural handwritten flow.\nThe expansive horizontal presence and delicate connections between characters provide a high-end, personalized aesthetic. This font is a perfect choice for luxury wedding stationery, intimate event branding, high-end editorial signatures, and sophisticated lifestyle photography overlays.",
